<p id="p2">Today, <a href="https://apple.co/4xFO89w" rel="noopener noreferrer">Jungle</a> released their fifth studio album, <a href="https://apple.co/45YEuTI" rel="noopener noreferrer">Sunshine</a>. Alongside the release, Apple published a look at how the band used <a href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app-bundle/apple-creator-studio/id1868448255?mt=12&amp;platform=iphone" rel="noopener noreferrer">Apple Creator Studio</a> to film 11 music videos in just four days, an impressive feat no matter the technology used.</p>
